From: Largo <Largo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 09:21:37 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] chunkybacon JRuby lesson build: json ext, Jackson, ZXing,
 lesson.Quakes

On top of 730d53b, the build behind https://chunkybacon.idogawa.com's JRuby
lesson (tools/jruby.json there):

- the json gem 2.21.2 Java extension (gems-src/json/ext), compiled into
  jruby.js; stdlib.zip gets json/ext/{parser,generator}.rb stubs
- jackson-core 2.18.2 and ZXing core 3.5.4 on TeaVM's classpath, fetched
  from Maven Central with SHA-256 checks by setup/fetch.sh
- lesson.Quakes (demo-src/lesson), the Java loop the lesson shows
- AtomicInteger / ConcurrentHashMap in java-classes.txt
- TCharset aliases + isSupported, TCharConversionException (compat)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
